{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Exit 8, The Underpass is an anomaly hunting game in which you must remember your surroundings and spot any differences in order to escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At release the game has 30+ anomalies, with an average gameplay length of 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system so you never lose progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been discovered, making completionist runs easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable graphics settings, allowing the game to run on a wide variety of PCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility settings like toggle sprint, disabling effects such as motion blur, camera sway, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashing lights, large moving patterns or other photosensitive epilepsy triggers*.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you discover a potential epilepsy trigger or other accessibility issue that I have missed, please let me know via the Steam forums!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111120?t=1761232783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111120/c234b79f1b13b404d4c810748991761861d988c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761232783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111120/19ec2383b3155a94dbaa0f9846956f005f00f2e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761232783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111120/19ec2383b3155a94dbaa0f9846956f005f00f2e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761232783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Exit 8, The Underpass is an anomaly hunting game in which you must remember your surroundings and spot any differences in order to escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At release the game has 30+ anomalies, with an average gameplay length of 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system so you never lose progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been discovered, making completionist runs easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable graphics settings, allowing the game to run on a wide variety of PCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility settings like toggle sprint, disabling effects such as motion blur, camera sway, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashing lights, large moving patterns or other photosensitive epilepsy triggers*.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you discover a potential epilepsy trigger or other accessibility issue that I have missed, please let me know via the Steam forums!</p>","developers":["Journeyman Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111120/2